<title>UK: Ransomes sees H1 profit below expectations.</title>
<headline>Ransomes sees H1 profit below expectations.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>British lawnmower maker Ransomes Plc said on Friday its first-half pretax profit would be substantially lower than current market expectations and the company's year-earlier results.</p>
</text>
